TI  - Advancing Sustainable Water Management in Southern Italy Through Integrated Hydrological Modeling and Earth Observation
T2  - COMPUTATIONAL SCIENCE AND ITS APPLICATIONS-ICCSA 2024 WORKSHOPS, PT V
LA  - English
