AB  - This conference abstract introduces a Smart Irrigation System leveraging Arduino technology for precision agriculture. The system combines Arduino microcontrollers with soil moisture and weather sensors to allow for intelligent decision-making and real-time monitoring. By optimizing water usage through automated control of solenoid valves based on soil conditions and weather forecasts, the proposed system offers a cost-effective and sustainable solution for modern farming practices. Project presentation highlights the potential of Arduino in advancing agricultural efficiency and resource conservation. © 2024 IEEE.
